<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION DRAWS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION DRAWS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draws for the three African club</p>
<p>soccer competitions made on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Champions' League:</p>
<p>Group A - Orlando Pirates (South Africa), Primeiro de Agosto</p>
<p>(Angola), U.S.M. Alger (Algeria), Raja (Morocco)</p>
<p>Group B - Zamalek (Egypt), Obuasi Goldfields (Ghana),</p>
<p>Ferroviario (Mozambique), Club Africain (Tunisia)</p>
<p>Match schedule:</p>
<p>August 22-23-24</p>
<p>Orlando Pirates v Primeiro de Agosto</p>
<p>U.S.M. Alger v Raja</p>
<p>Zamalek v Ferroviario</p>
<p>Club Africain v Obuasi Goldfields</p>
<p>September 5-6-7</p>
<p>Primeiro de Agosto v Raja</p>
<p>U.S.M. Alger v Orlando Pirates</p>
<p>Ferroviario v Obuasi Goldfields</p>
<p>Club Africain v Zamalek</p>
<p>September 19-20-21</p>
<p>Primeiro de Agosto v U.S.M. Alger</p>
<p>Raja v Orlando Pirates</p>
<p>Ferroviario v Club Africain</p>
<p>Obuasi Goldfields v Zamalek</p>
<p>October 10-11-12</p>
<p>Primeiro de Agosto v Orlando Pirates</p>
<p>Raja v U.S.M. Alger</p>
<p>Ferroviario v Zamalek</p>
<p>Obuasi Goldfields v Club Africain</p>
<p>October 24-25-26</p>
<p>Raja v Primeiro de Agosto</p>
<p>Orlando Pirates v U.S.M. Alger</p>
<p>Obuasi Goldfields v Ferroviario</p>
<p>Zamalek v Club Africain</p>
<p>November 7-8-9</p>
<p>U.S.M. Alger v Primeiro de Agosto</p>
<p>Orlando Pirates v Raja</p>
<p>Club Africain v Ferroviario</p>
<p>Zamalek v Obuasi Goldfields</p>
<p>November 28-29-30</p>
<p>Winner of group B v winner of group A</p>
<p>December 12-13-14</p>
<p>Winner of group A v winner of group B</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup:</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1. D.S.A. (Madagascar) v Jasper United (Nigeria)</p>
<p>2. Petro Atletico (Angola) v USM Ein Beida (Algeria)</p>
<p>3. Kampala City (Uganda) v Leopards (Kenya)</p>
<p>4. Esperance (Tunisia) v Coton Sport (Cameroon)</p>
<p>First legs September 5/6/7, second legs September 19/20/21</p>
<p>Semi-finals</p>
<p>5. Winner 1 v winner 2</p>
<p>6. Winner 3 v winner 4</p>
<p>First legs October 10/11/12, second legs October 24/25/26.</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>7. Winner 5 v winner 6</p>
<p>First leg November 14/15/16, second leg November 28/29/30</p>
<p>In all cases the first named club will play at home in the</p>
<p>first leg</p>
<p>Cup Winners' Cup:</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1. Mansoura (Egypt) v Jomo Cosmos (South Africa)</p>
<p>2. Arab Contractors (Egypt) v Etoile Sportive du Sahel</p>
<p>(Tunisia)</p>
<p>3. St Louisienne (Reunion) v S.O.A. (Cote d'Ivoire)</p>
<p>4. F.A.R. (Morocco) v. MC Oran (Algeria)</p>
<p>First legs September 5/6/7, second legs September 19/20/21.</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>5. Winner 2 v winner 1</p>
<p>6. Winner 4 v winner 3</p>
<p>First legs October 10/11/12, second legs October 24/25/26</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>7. Winner 6 v winner 5</p>
<p>First leg November 21/22/23, second leg December 5/6/7</p>
<p>In all cases the first named club will play at home in the</p>
<p>first leg.</p>
</text>
